---
import '../styles/home-turntable.css';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>谢擎宇｜产品体验设计师</title>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#F7F7F4">
  <meta name="description" content="谢擎宇的产品体验设计作品集，记录复杂业务、AI 工作流与视觉系统的设计实践。">

</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">跳到主要内容</a>
<header class="bar">
  <a class="bar__name" href="#main">谢擎宇</a>
  <nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="#selected-work">作品</a><a href="#about">关于</a><a class="bar__mail" href="mailto:second988@qq.com" aria-label="发送邮件至 second988@qq.com">联系 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav>
</header>
<main class="stage" id="main" tabindex="-1">
  <div class="showcase">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="intro">
      <h1 id="home-title">产品体验设计师</h1>
      <p class="intro__lead">我擅长复杂业务产品的体验设计，有视觉与品牌设计背景。也用 AI 将设计判断做成可操作的原型、工具和评审工作流。</p>
      <div class="intro__actions"><a class="resume" href="/resume/xie-qingyu-resume.pdf" download="谢擎宇-体验设计师简历.pdf">下载简历 · PDF <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a href="mailto:second988@qq.com">second988@qq.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="workstation">
  <div class="listening">
  <section class="collection" id="selected-work" aria-label="作品唱片架">
    <p class="collection__hint">点选，看看不同实践 <span aria-hidden="true">↙</span></p>
    <ul class="crate" aria-label="选择项目">
      <li>
        <button class="sleeve" type="button" data-select="0" style="--disc: #ed5636" aria-pressed="true" aria-controls="work-0" aria-label="选择房产 GIS 体验重构">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/gis-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">01</span><span class="sleeve__title">房产 GIS 体验重构</span></span>
        </button>
      </li>
      <li>
        <button class="sleeve" type="button" data-select="1" style="--disc: #328bd2" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="work-1" aria-label="选择把设计经验整理成可复用的 AI 工作流">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/review-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">02</span><span class="sleeve__title">AI 评审工作流</span></span>
        </button>
      </li>
      <li>
        <button class="sleeve" type="button" data-select="2" style="--disc: #e6b42e" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="work-2" aria-label="选择新禾智飞品牌系统提案">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/brand-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">03</span><span class="sleeve__title">新禾智飞品牌系统</span></span>
        </button>
      </li>
      <li>
        <button class="sleeve" type="button" data-select="3" style="--disc: #36a879" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="work-3" aria-label="选择执行网查询助手">
          <span class="sleeve__record" aria-hidden="true"><span class="record__grooves"></span><span class="record__label"></span></span>
          <span class="sleeve__cover" data-protected-media><img src="/images/home/covers/query-v5.webp" alt="" width="640" height="640" draggable="false"></span>
          <span class="sleeve__caption"><span class="sleeve__number">04</span><span class="sleeve__title">执行网查询助手</span></span>
        </button>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
    <div class="player">
<div class="deck" data-deck data-phase="idle" role="img" aria-label="唱机，当前唱片为房产 GIS 体验重构">

      <span class="deck__frame" aria-hidden="true"></span>

      <div class="platter" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="record" data-record>
          <span class="record__grooves"></span>
          <span class="record__label"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="arm" data-arm aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="arm__weight"></span>
        <span class="arm__pivot"></span>
        <span class="arm__head"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="tuner" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="tuner__scale"></span>
        <span class="tuner__needle"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="deck__foot" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="deck__spec">33⅓ RPM</span>
        <span class="deck__led"></span>
      </div>

    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="panel" aria-label="当前作品介绍">
    <div class="panel__head">
      <div class="sides" role="group" aria-label="切换介绍内容">
        <button class="side" type="button" data-side="a" aria-pressed="true">A 面 · 设计思路</button>
        <button class="side" type="button" data-side="b" aria-pressed="false">B 面 · 作品成果</button>
      </div>
      <p class="panel__keys"><span><button type="button" data-direction="left" aria-label="上一张唱片">←</button><button type="button" data-direction="right" aria-label="下一张唱片">→</button> 选作品</span><span><button type="button" data-direction="up" aria-label="切换 A/B 面">↑</button><button type="button" data-direction="down" aria-label="切换 A/B 面">↓</button> 切换 A/B 面</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel__body">
      <article class="work" id="work-0" data-work="0" aria-labelledby="work-title-0">
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-0">房产 GIS 体验重构</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a">房产工作人员要在地图上找到楼栋、查看整幢，再核对测绘后的房屋关系。我重构了总图、整幢和核对任务，让楼栋信息沿操作路径连续呈现。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden>三个可操作原型覆盖总图、整幢与实测替换预测。结合真实界面截图和重构前后对照，可以查看信息关系、操作路径与核对方式的具体变化。</p>
        </div>
        <a class="work__open" href="/work/real-estate-gis/">打开案例 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="work" id="work-1" data-work="1" aria-labelledby="work-title-1" hidden>
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-1">把设计经验整理成可复用的 AI 工作流</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a">全选漏了其他页，取消后又无法下载。这些项目里的问题让我开始整理检查方法。我把经验写成给 AI 使用的评审规则，由设计师确认业务要求和取舍，再用真实任务持续修正。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden>从真实设计评审中整理检查规则，保留实际评审建议与规则回查记录。案例展示如何把具体问题写成 AI 可使用的规则，以及设计师如何确认建议和业务取舍。</p>
        </div>
        <a class="work__open" href="/work/edgecase-planner/">打开案例 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="work" id="work-2" data-work="2" aria-labelledby="work-title-2" hidden>
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-2">新禾智飞品牌系统提案</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a">不同供应商制作的物料放在一起，很难看出来自同一个品牌。我设计了标识组合、颜色字体规范和制作模板，让后续物料有共同的依据。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden>24 页品牌规范与六个子系统提案，包含标识组合、颜色字体规范和制作模板。结合已投产的旧触点，展示从问题梳理到统一规范的设计过程。</p>
        </div>
        <a class="work__open" href="/work/brand-system/">打开案例 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="work" id="work-3" data-work="3" aria-labelledby="work-title-3" hidden>
        <div class="work__heading"><h2 class="work__title" id="work-title-3">执行网查询助手</h2></div>
        <div class="work__faces">
          <p class="work__text" data-face="a">律师按名单复核执行记录，需要反复查询和整理。官网验证升级后，旧工具难以继续查询。我保留人工验证，让本地助手接着处理名单、比较结果并生成表格。</p>
          <p class="work__text" data-face="b" hidden>案例展示人工验证、批量查询、结果比较与表格导出的工作流程，并提供 5 张界面截图和两项合成任务的真实浏览器验收记录。</p>
        </div>
        <a class="work__open" href="/work/execution-query/">打开案例 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="sr-only" data-announcement aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
    <noscript><p class="no-script">四个案例可以直接阅读 <a href="/work/real-estate-gis/">房产 GIS</a>、<a href="/work/edgecase-planner/">AI 评审</a>、<a href="/work/brand-system/">品牌系统提案</a>、<a href="/work/execution-query/">执行网助手</a>。</p></noscript>
  </section>
  </div>
  </div>
  <section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <h2 id="about-title">关于</h2>
    <div><p>12 年设计经验，横跨视觉、品牌与产品体验，参与过低空智航、房屋安全等领域的设计。现在用 AI 开发原型与工具，将评审经验整理成规则，验证设计想法。</p></div>
  </section>
</main>
<script src="../scripts/turntable.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
